#: includes/views/seo-score-page.php:400
msgid ""
"We tested about ten AI vision models on the same set of test images for "
"accuracy, speed and cost. The models offered here returned a valid result "
"for every test image, and every provider has at least one, so you can use "
"whichever API key you have."
msgstr ""
"Kami menguji sekitar sepuluh model visi AI pada set gambar uji yang sama "
"untuk akurasi, kecepatan, dan biaya. Model yang ditawarkan di sini "
"memberikan hasil yang valid untuk setiap gambar uji, dan setiap penyedia "
"memiliki setidaknya satu, sehingga Anda dapat menggunakan kunci API mana pun"
" yang Anda miliki."

#: includes/views/seo-score-page.php:436
msgid ""
"Est. Cost/Image: measured in November 2026 on 20 test images, for a full "
"optimization (keywords, filename, alt text and title). You pay the provider "
"directly, and prices change."
msgstr ""
"Perkiraan Biaya/Gambar: diukur pada November 2026 pada 20 gambar uji, untuk "
"optimasi penuh (kata kunci, nama file, teks alt, dan judul). Anda membayar "
"penyedia secara langsung, dan harga dapat berubah."

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/partials/panel-nav.php:41
msgid "Continue without a key"
msgstr "Lanjutkan tanpa kunci"

#. translators: 1: cost in US dollars, e.g. "$1.46", 2: AI model name, e.g.
#. "Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite"
#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-api-keys.php:63
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Measured in November 2026 on 20 test images: about %1$s per 1,000 images "
"with %2$s. You pay the provider directly, and prices change."
msgstr ""
"Diukur pada November 2026 pada 20 gambar uji: sekitar %1$s per 1.000 gambar "
"dengan %2$s. Anda membayar penyedia secara langsung, dan harga dapat "
"berubah."

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-complete.php:43
msgid "Almost done: connect an AI provider"
msgstr "Hampir selesai: sambungkan penyedia AI"

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-complete.php:47
msgid ""
"Your preferences are saved. WordPress AI is selected as the connection, but "
"no AI connector is set up yet, so images cannot be optimized. Set one up in "
"Settings → Connectors."
msgstr ""
"Preferensi Anda telah disimpan. AI WordPress dipilih sebagai koneksi, tetapi"
" belum ada konektor AI yang diatur, sehingga gambar tidak dapat "
"dioptimalkan. Atur satu di Pengaturan → Konektor."

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-complete.php:49
msgid ""
"Your preferences are saved, but no working AI connection is set up yet, so "
"images cannot be optimized. Add an API key for one of the supported "
"providers on the API Keys page."
msgstr ""
"Preferensi Anda telah disimpan, tetapi belum ada koneksi AI yang berfungsi "
"yang diatur, sehingga gambar tidak dapat dioptimalkan. Tambahkan kunci API "
"untuk salah satu penyedia yang didukung di halaman Kunci API."

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-complete.php:62
msgid "Missing: a configured WordPress AI connector"
msgstr "Tidak ada: konektor AI WordPress yang dikonfigurasi"

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-complete.php:64
msgid "Missing: a working API key for the selected AI model"
msgstr "Tidak ada: kunci API yang berfungsi untuk model AI yang dipilih"

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-complete.php:82
msgid "Set up a connector"
msgstr "Atur konektor"

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-complete.php:86
msgid "Add an API key"
msgstr "Tambahkan kunci API"

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-complete.php:91
msgid "Go to the dashboard"
msgstr "Pergi ke dasbor"

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-preferences.php:65
msgid ""
"Optional — just continue if you're not sure. Your answer is only sent to us "
"if you subscribe to updates below."
msgstr ""
"Opsional — lanjutkan saja jika Anda tidak yakin. Jawaban Anda hanya dikirim "
"kepada kami jika Anda berlangganan pembaruan di bawah ini."

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-preferences.php:92
msgid ""
"The AI writes in your content language. The library size is optional and is "
"only sent to us if you subscribe to updates below."
msgstr ""
"AI menulis dalam bahasa konten Anda. Ukuran perpustakaan bersifat opsional "
"dan hanya dikirim kepada kami jika Anda berlangganan pembaruan di bawah ini."

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-preferences.php:235
msgid ""
"Media, image, post, page, and product counts. Helps us understand the "
"library sizes the plugin is used with."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah media, gambar, pos, halaman, dan produk. Membantu kami memahami "
"ukuran perpustakaan yang digunakan plugin."

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-welcome.php:52
msgid "Safe Renaming"
msgstr "Penggantian Nama Aman"

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-welcome.php:53
msgid ""
"Renamed images are updated in your content, and old URLs redirect to the new"
" file"
msgstr ""
"Gambar yang diganti namanya diperbarui dalam konten Anda, dan URL lama "
"diarahkan ke file baru"

#: includes/views/setup-wizard/steps/step-welcome.php:65
msgid "Improve search visibility and accessibility"
msgstr "Tingkatkan visibilitas pencarian dan aksesibilitas"

